  "kitkatvisuals.tut.intro.title": "Welcome to KitKatVisuals",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.intro.p1": "A client mod packed with visual features: swing animations, HUD, crosshair, minimap, ESP and much more.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.intro.p2": "We will show the basics in a couple of minutes. You can skip this at any time: press \"Skip tutorial\" or Esc.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.open.title": "How to open the menu",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.open.p1": "Press %s to open the ClickGUI: all features of the mod live there.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.open.p2": "You can change the key in Options > Controls > KitKatVisuals.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.use.title": "How to use features",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.use.p1": "Left click a feature to turn it on or off.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.use.p2": "Right click a feature (or the arrow on the right) to open its settings.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.use.p3": "The \"Bind\" row in settings assigns a key to the feature (Esc clears it).",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.use.p4": "Use the search at the top to find features and settings. The Configs tab saves your own setups.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.use.p5": "HUD windows can be dragged with the mouse while the chat is open; right click puts them back.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.use.p6": "Next is the list of all features by section. Pick a section above to jump to it or skip it.",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.finish.title": "All set!",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.finish.p1": "Enable the features you like in the ClickGUI (%s).",
  "kitkatvisuals.tut.finish.p2": "You can open this tutorial again: the \"?\" button at the top right of the ClickGUI, or Settings > General.",
